# Wingling (the Hive): a flying swarmer. Chitin thorax and tapering abdomen, two broad wings with violet veins, violet
# eyes and a glowing stinger tip (its light cue). Original design. Dives in packs like the machines' swarmers.
name wingling
grid 5
size 22 24 10
slot shell Chitin
slot glow HiveViolet
ellipsoid 12 12 5 4 2.5 2.5 shell
ellipsoid 17 12 5 2.5 2 2 shell
box 18 10 5 20 11 7 glow
ellipsoid 5 12 4 5 2 2 shell
box 0 11 3 2 13 5 glow
poly 6 7 shell 14,10 17,2 12,0 9,4 11,10
paint beam 13 9 6.5 15.5 2 6.5 0.7 glow
paint beam 12 9 6.5 10 2 6.5 0.7 glow
mirror y
pivot 11 12 0
# R20 animation segments (Swarmer gait roles): the wings flap (roll) about the thorax sides.
part BladeL 0 0 0 22 9 10 13 9 6
part BladeR 0 15 0 22 24 10 13 15 6
